ItemDisplay[STAT360=0 GROUND FILTLVL>4 FILTLVL<7 BELT ID (MAG OR RARE OR CRAFT) !(FCR>0 OR IAS>0 OR FHR>0 OR (FRES+CRES+LRES+PRES>29) OR STAT36>0 OR STAT40>0 OR STAT42>0 OR STAT44>0 OR STAT46>0)]:
ItemDisplay[STAT360=0 GROUND FILTLVL>4 FILTLVL<7 CHEST ID (MAG OR RARE OR CRAFT) !(STAT153>0 OR (ETH REPAIR>0 EDEF>0) OR FCR>19 OR CLSK0>1 OR CLSK1>1 OR CLSK2>1 OR CLSK3>1 OR CLSK4>1 OR CLSK5>1 OR CLSK6>1 OR SOCK>3 OR STAT36>9 OR EDAM>99 OR ((CLSK0>0 OR CLSK1>0 OR CLSK2>0 OR CLSK3>0 OR CLSK4>0 OR CLSK5>0 OR CLSK6>0) (LIFE>29 OR STR>14 OR DEX>14 OR FCR>0 OR STAT110>0 OR SOCK>1)))]: // keep ETH + repair + ED, 20 FCR, +2 class skills, 4os, 10+ PDR, 100+ ED, or +skills with a stat / FCR / PLR / 2+ sockets
ItemDisplay[STAT360=0 GROUND FILTLVL>4 FILTLVL<7 !CLASS SHIELD ID (MAG OR RARE OR CRAFT) !(STAT153>0 OR SOCK>3 OR STAT36>0 OR EDAM>0 OR CLSK0>0 OR CLSK1>0 OR CLSK2>0 OR CLSK3>0 OR CLSK4>0 OR CLSK5>0 OR CLSK6>0 OR FCR>0 OR IAS>0 OR FHR>0 OR (FRES+CRES+LRES+PRES>29) OR STAT40>0 OR STAT42>0 OR STAT44>0 OR STAT46>0)]:
